02:39.240 --> 02:48.680
It's just a tiny portion of even a thousand years and just trying to open up some space for people to imagine that if,

02:48.960 --> 02:55.360
if they didn't always exist, if the police in this formation didn't always exist, then surely they don't have to always exist.

